  "full_chain_findings": [
    "Whole CREATURE class registers Animal ground spawn rules and config-roll check. Default weight10/rolls0 can be loaded-overridden; no biome or installed spawn opportunity claim. Constructor fishingCooldown1200+RNG0..1199; isFood=false/no breed goal. Offspring factory alone is not breeding.",
    "Hand interaction luck-tag branch precedes lure, requires alive; earned level<10 increments clamp0..10, requests eat/particle/sound then shrinks1. No explicit server or creative guard in these shown branches. At cap returns success/beak-shake with no charge. Tag overlap selects luck even at max, no fallthrough.",
    "Hand lure feed also clamps CURRENT cooldown-200 into200..2400; dropped lure does not shorten current timer. Dropped predicate is FOODSTUFFS OR luck-below-cap OR lure-below-cap. Helper callback onGetItem runs BEFORE shrink1, then stop; callback stage does not recheck membership/current cap. Foodstuff overlap may still be eaten at cap. Eat/sound/heal5 and stack consumption are not actual player payment/ownership receipt.",
    "Reset timer=max(1200+RNG0..1199-lure*120,200). Earned lure10 gives max(RNG0..1199,200), not constant200. Luck contributes level*.5 to loot context. Save/read Flying/FishingTimer/Luck/Lure/Revenge direct/unclamped; absent timer0 differs constructor random. Existing migration owner already accepted durable earned-upgrade whole policy,0 new migration/global novelty.",
    "Fish canUse: !flying && cooldown==0 && random1/30. Current water bypasses shore search; otherwise15 range32 samples descend air and retain LAST valid water. Valid-water tests water/horizontal empty-fluid neighbor/above empty-fluid, not walkable floor/collision/fish population. getLandPos provides first direction nonnull token; actual navigation moves to waterPos, not landPos.",
    "Continuation requires targetPos token/cooldown0/revenge0/!flying, no water or path revalidation. Near water squared<=1 resets navTime, stops navigation and accumulates idleTime; >25requests animation, >45while fish-animation completes. Away ticks do NOT clear idleTime; thresholds are cumulative near goal invocations, not consecutive world ticks. navTime>3600 away-stop resets near, not absolute timeout.",
    "Completion requests splash/event then RESETS COOLDOWN BEFORE spawnFishingLoot and stop. Loot uses BuiltInLootTables.FISHING and luck with EMPTY custom LootContextParamSet; registered native FISHING requires ORIGIN/TOOL. Read empty builder and registered-set definitions. Actual table content/conditions unexamined: no guaranteed loot, failure/exception or native fishing-equivalence claim. Earlier native data/params/table/resolver/goal/ForgeHooks proofs reused0.",
    "Each returned stack requests new ItemEntity then addFreshEntity; return ignored. No nonempty-output check/admission receipt/player owner UUID/pickup/inventory transfer/refund. Empty list still spends cooldown. Later failure would follow prior timer write, but no runtime failure demonstrated. Entity construction or feedback does not certify material acquisition.",
    "Flight-flee starts flying, continues flying&&(executionTime<15||airborne), seeks landing when revenge0, stop clears flying. Fish priority1/flee4 share MOVE. Fish initial canUse lacks revenge check while continuation includes it; no scheduler race/exploit claim without native execution. Hurt/animation attack code is not strict KILLED proof.",
    "One whole policy maximum: durable paid productivity upgrades drive repeated habitat fishing with asymmetric feed paths and cooldown-before-unchecked-output. Distinct from raccoon one-food postwash taming, platypus per-charge excavation/partial tier persistence, seal third-offering player-return entitlement, toucan retained seed-block placement. Helpers/stats/tags/thresholds/branches do not split into extra references. Independent ecology applicability/dedup pending,0 formal now."
  ],
